  <item>
    <title>E35 《从唐诗走进历史》：趁热读了一本小书</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647819616752b5f9deadccfa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647819616752b5f9deadccfa</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Jun 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《从唐诗走进历史》是今年4月出版的新书（还热乎着），作者是唐史学者宁欣。以诗为媒，从唐诗出发，深入浅出地看唐朝的二十九个侧面。简单分享了一些我们在书中看到并觉得有意思的章节，非常推荐大家去看原书（微信读书已有电子版）</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>你能听到：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> &nbsp;乌衣巷口夕阳斜：社会阶层的大变动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> &nbsp;唐代的科举制度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a> 唐代文人的自我营销</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1446">24:06</a> 进入中原的佛教</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2279">37:59</a> 颜真卿和放夫案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2694">44:54</a> 绢马贸易：双方都在以次充好，但持续了80年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2975">49:35</a> 唐代商业鬼才的前传</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3485">58:05</a> 狂放不羁的五陵年少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3807">1:03:27</a> 唐代城市格局的变迁</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期参与：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>主播 ｜ viva、吱吱、爱娃</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作 ｜ 吱吱</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>欢迎关注我们的公众号：零卡俱乐部</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
