  <item>
    <title>E34 《宫女谈往录》：“宫女的生活就是四个字，真哭假笑”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6465f8bd53a5e5ea146666a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6465f8bd53a5e5ea146666a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 May 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天来看金易、沈义羚先生合著的长篇纪实文学《宫女谈往录》，记述了一位随侍慈禧前后达八年之久的宫女荣儿对往事的回忆。荣儿在讲述往事时，文字中总透露着压抑的气氛，有一种虚幻感，宫里就像一个大戏台，每个人都在演戏。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>你能听到：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 宫女们眼中的慈禧，和颜悦色且极度自律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 慈禧太后的生活很有节奏感，讲究顺应天时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> 宫里不能大声说话，那要如何传递消息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> 储秀宫的味道，是喜气洋洋的味道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a> 太监净身，就是死过一回了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2733">45:33</a> 慈禧逃亡，所有的礼节崩塌在三辆马车里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3117">51:57</a> 清朝的最后一任太子溥儁（jùn）在逃亡路上的离谱行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3606">1:00:06</a> 宫女虽然能吃到好东西，但从来不敢吃饱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3832">1:03:52</a> 清宫的繁文缛节感觉比其他朝代更甚</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期参与：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>主播 ｜ 吱吱、viva、爱娃</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作 ｜ 吱吱</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>欢迎关注我们的公众号：零卡俱乐部</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqjurYJ6FI1d9PB5rPO1QrDP5LWO.m4a" length="67960847" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:09:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjSDgUotGFY54IVitEFUc4459NGf.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E33 嘉靖和“一口锅引发的战争”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6463273894d78eb3f721c5c4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6463273894d78eb3f721c5c4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 May 2023 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>延期更新了dbq，顺着上次聊的天坛，这次来简单聊聊对天坛布局影响极大的几位皇帝之一——明朝的嘉靖皇帝朱厚熜。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>你能听到：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 天上掉下一个皇位给嘉靖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a> 即位引发“大礼仪”之争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1064">17:44</a> &nbsp;嘉靖给自己取了70个字的道号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1184">19:44</a> 宫女们联合刺杀皇帝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1674">27:54</a> 嘉靖改建天坛，但改完只去过6次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1899">31:39</a> 一口锅引发的战争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2339">38:59</a> 像炒股一样玩弄大臣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2717">45:17</a> 权利的三幅面孔</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期参与：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>主播 ｜ 吱吱、viva、爱娃</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作 ｜ 吱吱</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>欢迎关注我们的公众号：零卡俱乐部</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
