  <item>
    <title>E32 北京天坛旅游指南，但近期劝退</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/644b6a8694d78eb3f7a9d74f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">644b6a8694d78eb3f7a9d74f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Apr 2023 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>天坛还是很有意思的，它蕴含了古人的宇宙观，在那里能感受到人对自然的敬畏，烦躁的心情也会平静下来。但不太建议大家最近去北京天坛，一个是人太多了，真的太多了！另一个是天坛最近在修缮，涉及的建筑还蛮多的，可能会影响参观体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家五一假期快乐，无论去哪里都要玩得开心呀！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BTW 故宫的犍陀罗佛像展，如果能约到的话请一定要去！！！</span></p><span></span><h1><strong><span>你能听到：</span></strong></h1><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">1:53</a> &nbsp;“北京小孩都知道的，要在天坛喊五谷丰登！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">4:52</a> 北京天坛第一印象——树，真，多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">6:28</a> 行前准备，注意看清景点的开放时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">11:14</a> 七星石，但是有八块石头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a> 最初建造的北京天坛是什么样子的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a> 由方变圆，从大祀殿到祈年殿的前世今生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a> 回音壁，为什么能传音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a> 乾隆、青蛙，和回音壁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 三音石，能听到三次回音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2203">36:43</a> 光绪重建祈年殿，没有图纸，全靠老工匠回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2378">39:38</a> 祈年殿的柱子有哪些讲究</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2474">41:14</a> 古人为什么要祭天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2576">42:56</a> 冬至祭天、孟春祈谷，圜丘坛、祈年殿的功能划分</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期参与：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播 ｜ 吱吱、viva、爱娃</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作 ｜ 吱吱</span></p><span></span><h1><span>欢迎关注我们的公众号：零卡俱乐部</span></h1><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgc5SKt9xeq9iI_rtBMRzCecUH7f.m4a" length="69136646" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjSDgUotGFY54IVitEFUc4459NGf.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E31 《美人图》：古代女性对美的追求</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64450d719c5a80f4e4c1576d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64450d719c5a80f4e4c1576d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Apr 2023 10:50:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上次在《敦煌壁画中的妇女生活》里没有看到我们想知道的内容，这次在《美人图》里倒是看到了一些。《美人图》介绍了一些古代女性的生活雅趣，她们追求美的氛围、美的仪式感，是作者孟晖的古典生活美学随笔集。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>你能听到：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a> 袖里春：将春天藏在袖子里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">05:52</a> 《杜阳杂编》里吃香料的女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">07:46</a> 卢媚儿的莲花香丸和人设营销</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> 楚莲香“蜂蝶相随”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 骨感美的先锋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> 赵飞燕与留仙裙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1243">20:43</a> 元宵节的当季头饰——灯球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">22:54</a> 女孩子们聚会吃酒要换三套衣服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 李治可能从没见过武则天素颜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2259">37:39</a> 杜十娘与便携百宝箱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2645">44:05</a> 古代的幻影魔术酒杯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2726">45:26</a> 叶笺寄相思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2832">47:12</a>《桃花扇》里的盒子会</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期参与：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>主播 ｜ viva、爱娃、吱吱</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作 ｜ 吱吱</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>欢迎关注我们的公众号：零卡俱乐部</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhKU0ZdW4z97PAoHFHoCAZaV9KZ_.m4a" length="82947527" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjSDgUotGFY54IVitEFUc4459NGf.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E30 《发现藏经洞》：令人叹惋的一段历史</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/643a6f709361a4e7c39bf384</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">643a6f709361a4e7c39bf384</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Apr 2023 09:33:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天来聊藏经洞。我们或多或少对藏经洞有一些了解和认知。但它在成为藏经洞之前是什么地方、为什么变成了藏经洞、敦煌还有没有第二个藏经洞了、藏经洞里件件都是珍品但具体有哪些东西？也许敦煌研究院主编的这本《发现藏经洞》会给到我们一些答案。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>你能听到：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;摸底考试——对藏经洞的基础认知是怎样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a> &nbsp;《发现藏经洞》这本书里包含哪些内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">06:11</a> &nbsp;成为藏经洞之前，这里本来是一位和尚的隐堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="531">08:51</a> &nbsp;为什么要把东西放进藏经洞？——避难说、废弃说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">10:33</a> &nbsp;第一个发现藏经洞的人——王圆箓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="801">13:21</a> &nbsp;第一个来到藏经洞的外国人——斯坦因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1121">18:41</a> &nbsp;人品不好没啥朋友的伯希和</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1301">21:41</a> &nbsp;后面来到藏经洞的几波外国人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> &nbsp;当时的国人如何对待藏经洞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1644">27:24</a> &nbsp;敦煌研究院的第一位院长——常书鸿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1773">29:33</a> &nbsp;藏经洞里有哪些宝藏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1885">31:25</a> &nbsp;藏经洞里的敦煌舞谱能破译吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2174">36:14</a> &nbsp;国外的博物馆该不该把藏经洞文物归还？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2684">44:44</a> 文物修旧如旧，还是让它维持你见到它时的样子？</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期参与：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>主播 ｜ 爱娃、吱吱、小潘</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作 ｜ 吱吱</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>欢迎关注我们的公众号：零卡俱乐部</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
