  <item>
    <title>E25 书中的压缩饼干：《十件古物中的丝路文明史》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640ad957acc110612ae9e509</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640ad957acc110612ae9e509</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 Mar 2023 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>继上次的《丝绸之路：十二种唐朝人生》之后，我们又打开了同作者的另一本书《十件古物中的丝路文明史》，发现难度系数直线上升，堪称书中的“压缩饼干”。这次先艰难啃完了三章跟大家简单分享一下。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>你能听到：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> &nbsp;《十件古物中的丝路文明史》称得上是书中的“压缩饼干”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a> &nbsp;中国历日：历日、日历傻傻分不清楚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a> &nbsp;民间自己印历日是违法的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;不适合的修复方式对这份历日造成了二次伤害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> &nbsp;巴克特里亚银壶：丝路大融合，吃百家饭长大的壶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1569">26:09</a> &nbsp;巴克特里亚是哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1933">32:13</a> &nbsp;一个北朝将军是怎么得到这个壶的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2054">34:14</a> &nbsp;拜占庭猎人丝绸：丝绸织造技术的传播</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2156">35:56</a> &nbsp;丝绸是怎么制作的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a> &nbsp;这块丝绸上的图像承载了哪些信息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3498">58:18</a> &nbsp;放弃把书中提到的古国疆域和现在一一对照后感到轻松一些了</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>中国历日（局部）</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>巴克特里亚银壶</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>现藏于大都会艺术博物馆的一件典型的萨珊银器</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>拜占庭猎人丝绸</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期参与：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>主播 ｜ 吱吱、爱娃、viva</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作 ｜ 吱吱</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>欢迎关注我们的公众号：零卡俱乐部</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmHEMtcA1LIO3ekF3DbgpNef6zFR.m4a" length="88224692" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjSDgUotGFY54IVitEFUc4459NGf.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E24 去了趟中国丝绸博物馆，一些参观小建议</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6401c66786730b8173628ee5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6401c66786730b8173628ee5</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Mar 2023 10:05:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前两天闪现去了趟杭州的中国丝绸博物馆，我们的整体参观时间差不多有5小时，主要也是为了做考察，所以比较久。给计划去丝绸博物馆参观的非专业观众朋友们划几个小重点吧：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.需要预约，但是人少，现场也可以预约；</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.博物馆的学术性比较强，展览也多，建议先去看最感兴趣的展览；</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.把这期节目听完，参观时也许会多一些乐趣hhhhh</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>你能听到：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">03:16</a> &nbsp;丝路馆的建筑结构像个剧场，动线有趣（但也会绕晕）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">04:31</a> &nbsp;展览《锦程》的学术性很强，非专业观众可能会觉得有点累</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">06:59</a> &nbsp;联珠对饮锦袍，“他们用的是高脚杯诶！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a> 唐立狮宝花纹锦，“美到令人忍不住要‘哇喔’。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> &nbsp;绫罗绸缎有什么分别，在这里可以搞清楚了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a> &nbsp;转角遇到一个莫高窟复制窟，有点惊喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> &nbsp;团窠联珠花树对鹿纹锦帽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> &nbsp;蚕宝宝的睡眠质量会影响到丝的品质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1642">27:22</a> &nbsp;博物馆里的书店也很好逛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">30:32</a> &nbsp;在修复馆是真的能看见工作人员在修复文物的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">30:32</a> 修复馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2057">34:17</a> &nbsp;时装馆和二楼的更衣记，旗袍爱好者请先去看这个展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2286">38:06</a> &nbsp;当我们谈论丝绸的时候，到底要谈些什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2639">43:59</a> &nbsp;如果把织错了的锦缎们放在一起做个展览，也很有趣吧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联珠对饮锦袍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."><img src="https://y8zdub9ffn.feishu.cn/space/api/box/stream/download/asynccode/?code=MTg2NDNkYmFiYzJhY2FiNzZlNjFiYjdlZTc3OTg4ZDJfb05BSUJBd2oxYzZKY3hrMGdJZ3llZk1IWHpQdDlRSDZfVG9rZW46Ym94Y25ZV2tzMEFDcDVHNlJJT1NweUZabXVkXzE2Nzc4Mzc4MjI6MTY3Nzg0MTQyMl9WNA"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>立狮宝花纹锦</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>团窠联珠花树对鹿纹锦帽</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."><img src="https://y8zdub9ffn.feishu.cn/space/api/box/stream/download/asynccode/?code=YjNlMjUzNTlmYTU5ZjY1ZjkzYmIzNTA0MWEwZTVkNDdfYWVKbDdiTDNCVVpXQnNPOFJobFFldDJXUDVMdlR4aHpfVG9rZW46Ym94Y25YdWpjc21rdXhyb04wcjRUQnoyamtlXzE2Nzc4Mzc4MjI6MTY3Nzg0MTQyMl9WNA"></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期参与：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>主播 ｜ 吱吱、爱娃、viva</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作 ｜ 吱吱</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>欢迎关注我们的公众号：零卡俱乐部</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgcr-6WDVeWPUAVXJYeieDqnIcC-.m4a" length="74282471" type="audio/mp4"/>
