  <item>
    <title>E22 跟唐代的营销鬼才们学了几手</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63ef0bdce99bdef7d3e85818</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ef0bdce99bdef7d3e85818</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Feb 2023 05:08:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>唐代商业的繁华大家多少都有所耳闻，今天主要来聊聊唐代的市场管理系统、激烈的商业竞争以及他们的广告营销方案。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>你能听到：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">02:51</a> 什么“东西”——唐代长安城的坊市制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> 每天击鼓300下开门营业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a> 唐代的市场管理组织要干些什么事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1033">17:13</a> 行肆店铺分别是什么意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1411">23:31</a> 长安的东、西市有不同的目标市场定位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1771">29:31</a> 跟唐代的市场营销鬼才学一手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a> 东西市的殡葬业商业竞争故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> 唐朝人怎么打广告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2869">47:49</a> 东西市里的商人都有谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3178">52:58</a> 唐代的富商有多富</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期参与：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>主播 ｜ 吱吱、爱娃、小鹿</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作 ｜ 吱吱</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>欢迎关注我们的公众号：零卡俱乐部</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p>]]></description>
